      <marc:subfield code="a">Mr. Kazuo Inamori is now 87 years old. Since founding Kyocera, he has achieved remarkable success in business management. In his later years, in 2010, he took on the role of Chairman of Japan Airlines and single-handedly rescued the company from the brink of bankruptcy and dissolution. Looking back on the many accomplishments throughout his life, one can&apos;t help but wonder: what kind of force empowered him to lead his teams through so many challenges? And in moments of critical decision-making, what beliefs guided him?</marc:subfield>
